From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SableOS <noreply@sableos.invalid>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 19:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] SableOS: Look step is the Profile step and no longer mentions dials

First-boot setup is Profile, Theme, Sable apps, in that order (the order
the script already had). The step before Theme was still called Look and
its text still described the status dials that were removed from both
homes. It is now the Profile step: BlackBerry 10 or BlackBerry 7, with
text that matches what the homes show. Strings only; the activity, the
action and the sable_look setting keep their names.
---
 app/src/main/res/values/sable_strings.xml | 14 +++++++-------
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/app/src/main/res/values/sable_strings.xml b/app/src/main/res/values/sable_strings.xml
index eda0f91..a232cf7 100644
--- a/app/src/main/res/values/sable_strings.xml
+++ b/app/src/main/res/values/sable_strings.xml
@@ -85,13 +85,13 @@
         <item>Slate</item>
     </string-array>
 
-    <!-- SableOS Look step (plan phase C), before Theme. "Style" because SableOS is not
-         BlackBerry: it only follows the look. -->
-    <string name="setup_sable_look">Look</string>
-    <string name="sable_look_summary">Choose how the home screen looks. You can change it later.</string>
-    <string name="sable_look_bb10"><b>BlackBerry 10 style</b>\nHub on the left, your open apps as Active Frames, the app grid on the right, status dials on top and pure black.</string>
-    <string name="sable_look_bb7"><b>BlackBerry 7 style</b>\nA banner with the clock and status over a tray of app icons, with pure black.</string>
-    <string name="sable_look_note">Change the home later from Sable Setup or the home screen’s menu, the dials in Edit Home. The look is black and white with one blue for focus.</string>
+    <!-- SableOS Profile step (the Look step of plan phase C), before Theme: BlackBerry 10 or
+         BlackBerry 7. SableOS is not BlackBerry: it follows the profile's look and behaviour. -->
+    <string name="setup_sable_look">Profile</string>
+    <string name="sable_look_summary">Choose your profile: BlackBerry 10 or BlackBerry 7. Theme and Sable apps come next, and all three can be changed later in Sable Setup.</string>
+    <string name="sable_look_bb10"><b>BlackBerry 10</b>\nHub on the left, your open apps as Active Frames and the app grid on the right, with pure black.</string>
+    <string name="sable_look_bb7"><b>BlackBerry 7</b>\nA banner with the date, weather and unread count over a tray of app icons, with pure black.</string>
+    <string name="sable_look_note">Change the profile later from Sable Setup or the home screen’s menu. The look is black and white with one blue for focus.</string>
 
     <!-- SableOS Sable apps step (plan phase C), after Theme. Apps left out are disabled, never
          uninstalled. -->
-- 
